WEBVTT

00:00:00.108 --> 00:00:05.004
This video shows how an administrator marks staff attendance on a phone.

00:00:06.684 --> 00:00:18.276
Tap the menu button at the top left, open HR and Staff, and choose Attendance. The page opens on today's date, and every staff member is a card that is still unmarked.

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:30.043
Tap Mark All Present to start from a full day. Every card now shows Present, and the counts at the top update.

00:00:34.611 --> 00:00:44.547
Now change one person. On the card of Bilal, open the Status list and choose Absent. The badge on the card changes to Absent.

00:00:48.431 --> 00:00:55.295
On the card of Kamran, choose Late. The Check In and Check Out times on the card are optional.

00:01:00.587 --> 00:01:08.363
Scroll up and tap Save All. A line beside the button says that attendance was saved for 7 staff members.

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:29.286
Tap the Summary tab. Each staff member has a card with working days, present, absent, late and the attendance rate for the last 30 days.

00:01:38.277 --> 00:01:43.533
Today's attendance is saved, and the Summary tab shows the last 30 days.
